# needs drag-scroll.scm (a long document): a drag selection which goes
# past the bottom of the view, then out of the window, scrolls the view
# (the canvas keeps the pointer while the button is held, and the editor
# centres the view on the point it asks for). F12 prints the scroll
# position and the selection: the second line must show a smaller scroll
# (the view went down) and a selection ending further in the document,
# the third one (after the release outside the window) the same selection
wait 9000
window #2
focus
wait 500
key F12
press 300 300
move 300 400
wait 200
move 300 700
wait 200
move 300 790
wait 300
move 300 800
wait 300
move 300 805
wait 300
move 300 900
wait 300
move 300 950
wait 300
move 300 1000
wait 300
move 300 1010
wait 300
move 300 1020
wait 300
key F12
snapshot drag
release 300 1020
wait 500
key F12
move 300 400
wait 500
key F12
snapshot released
